        "heading_size": 0,
        "heading_size_mobile": 0,
        "body": "<p>Meke Baby was born from lived experience, not assumption.Every product begins the same way:  A real problem. A real moment. A real need. From warming milk safely on the go to simplifying daily routines, the goal has always been the same — to make feeding easier, safer, and more considered for modern parents. Because when you’re in it — in the middle of the night, out of the house, or just trying to get through the day — small details matter.</p>",
